('entry:4592cdd4b78a9d8f66', 'CatalogMention', 'OmniSAT', 'VLA tokenizer using B-Splines for compact action representation. Two-stage encoding: (1) aligns different action chunk lengths into normalized fixed-length representation, (2) B-Spline encoder for compact representation, then VQ-VAE for discrete tokens. Improves upon both FAST and BEAST across LIBERO and SIMPLER', 'ResearchWork', 'category:action-representation-discrete-tokenization', NULL, 'INDEX_ONLY', '{"title":"OmniSAT: Compact Action Token, Faster Autoregression for Vision-Language-Action Models","catalogClaimedKind":"ResearchWork","categoryId":"category:action-representation-discrete-tokenization","sourceLine":294,"linkCount":0,"verificationStatus":"INDEX_ONLY"}', 'https://github.com/keon/awesome-physical-ai/blob/a6f62d11d9e7d1336a04927e86e3fbedc25a8456/README.md#L294', 'CURATED_INDEX', '693fd0b57a9bc74e0414f9256bf32dd88cc3b21b9f5c52a214b15a26ccbe08d2', '2026-09-06T03:39:17.673Z'),
