('entry:4636ec7eff05f930d8', 'CatalogMention', 'FASTer', 'Novel discrete action tokenizer combining Residual Vector Quantization (RVQ) with frequency L1 loss (DCT) and time domain L1 loss. Patchifies action tokens along temporal and grouped action dimension axes (e.g., base motion, arm joints). Higher compression ratio than FAST with strong results on SIMPLER and LIBERO', 'ResearchWork', 'category:action-representation-discrete-tokenization', NULL, 'INDEX_ONLY', '{"title":"FASTer: Toward Powerful and Efficient Autoregressive VLAs with Learnable Action Tokenizer and Block-Wise Decoding","catalogClaimedKind":"ResearchWork","categoryId":"category:action-representation-discrete-tokenization","sourceLine":291,"linkCount":0,"verificationStatus":"INDEX_ONLY"}', 'https://github.com/keon/awesome-physical-ai/blob/a6f62d11d9e7d1336a04927e86e3fbedc25a8456/README.md#L291', 'CURATED_INDEX', '693fd0b57a9bc74e0414f9256bf32dd88cc3b21b9f5c52a214b15a26ccbe08d2', '2026-09-06T03:39:17.673Z'),
