('entry:83b6ba6350878ffeaa', 'CatalogMention', 'UniVLA', 'Models vision, language, and actions as single interleaved stream of discrete tokens (VQ image tokens + FAST/DCT action tokens) in 8.5B autoregressive VLA. Two training stages: (1) post-train VLM with text/images to predict future frames, (2) finetune with vision and action token prediction. Emphasis on post-training stage to align VLM representations with robot tasks. Strong results on CALVIN, LIBERO, and SimplerEnv-Bridge', 'ResearchWork', 'category:vla-architectures-end-to-end-vlas', NULL, 'INDEX_LINKED', '{"title":"UniVLA: Unified Vision-Language-Action Model","catalogClaimedKind":"ResearchWork","categoryId":"category:vla-architectures-end-to-end-vlas","sourceLine":130,"linkCount":2,"verificationStatus":"INDEX_LINKED"}', 'https://github.com/keon/awesome-physical-ai/blob/a6f62d11d9e7d1336a04927e86e3fbedc25a8456/README.md#L130', 'CURATED_INDEX', '693fd0b57a9bc74e0414f9256bf32dd88cc3b21b9f5c52a214b15a26ccbe08d2', '2026-09-06T03:39:17.673Z'),
